{"id":"dessus","lemma":"dessus","pos":"adv","rank":317,"glosses":["on (it)","on top (of it)","upstairs"],"ipa":"/də.sy/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f4/Fr-dessus.ogg/Fr-dessus.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Je ne compte pas dessus.","en":"I'm not counting on it.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"account"},{"g":"not"},null]},{"text":"Aucun doute là-dessus.","en":"There's no doubt about it.","words":[{"g":"none, no-one"},{"g":"doubt"},{"g":"there"},null]},{"text":"Mets ce livre au-dessus des autres.","en":"Put this book on top of the others.","words":[{"g":"to put","l":"mettre"},{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"book"},{"g":"to the"},null,{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},{"g":"other","l":"autre"}]},{"text":"Qui s'est fait tirer dessus ?","en":"Who's been shot?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/251678","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"oneself / if"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"to draw, drag, pull"},null]},{"text":"Tu peux compter là-dessus.","en":"You can count on it.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"to count"},{"g":"there"},null]}]}